SUMMARY:Cancelled! Wildflower Sculpture Park Opening Reception
DESCRIPTION:South Mountain Conservancy Activities Meetup Group\n**Due to i
 ncoming weather this weekend\, we are postponing the opening of the WSP ne
 w season and holding our reception on Sunday\, September 27th from 3-5 PM.
 **\n\nThe [Wildflower Sculpture Park](https://www.somocon.org/visit/wildfl
 ower-sculpture-park/?mc_cid=887616f7ab&mc_eid=UNIQID) invites you to the o
 pening of this year’s project\, **Root System**\, a collaborative\, site
 -responsive exploration of roots\, rhizomes\, and interconnected systems o
 f life.\n\nCuratorial and artist talk will begin at 3:30pm. Light refreshm
 ents will be served.\n\nArtists were encouraged to consider how ecological
  networks within the South Mountain Reservation connect to community\, his
 tory\, and ancestry\, and to propose work that engages themes of resilienc
 e\, symbiosis\, and environmental stewardship.\n\nPresenting artists:\nANO
 NDA BELL\nCORRINE CARR\nCHRISTINE DACRUZ\nKATE EGGLESTON\nSAMAR HUSSAINI\n
 HAMEWS\nKAREN LEO\nALESSANDRA PUGLISI\nJIMENA VEGA\nWILLA VUCETAJ\n\nQuest
 ions? [wildflowersculpture@somocon.org](mailto:wildflowersculpture@somocon
 .org)
